## Storage locations

- Images → `media/img/`
- Podcasts/audio → `media/podcasts/`
- Videos → `media/videos/`
- Video overviews (descriptions) → `media/video-overview/`

## Linking rules

- Always link media with relative paths.
- Ensure referenced files exist and can preview on GitHub where supported.
- When adding or removing media, update `media/README.MD` or `media/media-list.md` as appropriate.

## Accessibility and context

- Provide descriptive link text; include brief context near embedded media links.
- Prefer lightweight previews (images, overview markdown) for heavy assets.
